OL,3,ASir Anthony Hopkins often 'returns' to
OL,4,AWales on Google Maps
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Anthony Hopkins may have left Wales
OL,7,Fto become a Hollywood star decades ago,
OL,8,Fbut he says he returns home in his mind
OL,9,Falmost every day, often looking around
OL,10,Fhis old neighbourhood on Google Maps.
OL,12,F"I go to streets and move up the
OL,13,Fstreet, the photographs of my streets
OL,14,Fin Wales... I'm always going back
OL,15,Fthere," said the Port Talbot-born
OL,16,FOscar-winner.
OL,18,FSir Anthony, 88, was speaking after the
OL,19,Frelease of his first album that he said
OL,20,Fhad been inspired by his childhood
OL,21,Fmemories.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
