OL,3,ASir Anthony Hopkins often 'returns' to
OL,4,AWales on Google Maps
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he was now a "bit too old" to
OL,7,Fgo back to Margam, Port Talbot to walk
OL,8,Fthe streets.
